    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="84.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 84.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And do nu eac lareowas ⁊ godcunde bydelas swa swa riht is ⁊ ealre manna ðearf is: bodian gelome godcunde ðearfe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And likewise teachers and spiritual messengers shall do what is right and for the well-being of all men: they shall frequently inculcate spiritual duties.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And don nu eac lareowas ⁊ godcunde bydelas, swa swa hit riht is ⁊ ealra manna þearf is: bodian gelome godcunde þearfe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
